"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"<p>Cozyology’s advanced memory shape technology ensures perfectly shaped drapes<br\/> with lasting elegance. Through years of innovation, we’ve crafted curtains with flawless drape and durability. <\/p>","enlarge_text":true}}},"block_order":["heading_giLc6k","text_XnazEB"],"settings":{"height":"small","text_alignment":"center","full_width":true,"color_scheme":"default"}},"multi_column_t94Ckr":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"text_block_ryzNp4":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/lQLPKHKGsFwOsw3M5szmsNVK-wgpxrxABi2Z-Y-lUgA_230_230.webp","title":"Step 1","text":"<p><strong>Perfectly Inspected Fabric<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","link":""}},"text_block_VLBHaW":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/memoryshapetechnical.webp","title":"Step 2","text":"<p><strong>Neatly Shaped with Precision<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","link":""}},"text_block_8MGDVH":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/lQLPKIQ2JzI4sKXM5szmsNOdk9CRotUXBitkxtOwHAA_230_230.webp","title":"Step 3","text":"<p><strong>Shape Locked Through Cooling<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","link":""}},"text_block_r4BjzM":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/lQLPJwNf3jbckKXM5szmsEQ4T4bno2ANBitkxwhlHgA_230_230.webp","title":"Step 4","text":"<p><strong>Tested for Quality and Durability<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["text_block_ryzNp4","text_block_VLBHaW","text_block_8MGDVH","text_block_r4BjzM"],"custom_css":["@media (max-width: 767px) {.flexible-layout {display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); grid-column-gap: 10px; grid-row-gap: 10px; }}"],"settings":{"title":"","media_aspect_ratio":"1","media_width":140,"text_alignment":"center","button_style":"primary","color_scheme":"default"}},"custom_content_BCHTzh":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_hBpnhQ":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"Packaging Designed to Protect the Pleats","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Packaging_Designed_to_Protect_the_Pleats.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_fbGeY3":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"Packaging Designed to Protect the Pleats","text":"<p>Memory shaped curtains are folded and packaged following the natural direction of the pleats, rather than being pressed flat.<br\/>This helps support the trained folds during transportation.<br\/><br\/>After unpacking, simply hang the curtains. The pleats will naturally settle back into their intended shape as the fabric relaxes.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_hBpnhQ","text_fbGeY3"],"name":"Custom content","settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"collapsible_tabs_kTqVG9":{"type":"collapsible-tabs","blocks":{"question_nRK6Hj":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How Memory Shape settles into its final look？","answer":"<p>Hang your curtains and allow the fabric to relax.<br\/>Light folds from careful packaging soften naturally; a gentle steam creates a perfectly tailored finish.<\/p>"}},"question_trNfPy":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Why are some header styles not available for memory training?","answer":"<p>Some header styles are designed to hold their shape through their structure and method of attachment. Once installed, they naturally form their intended appearance, so memory training is not necessary — for example, rod pocket headers.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_nRK6Hj","question_trNfPy"],"name":"Collapsible tabs","settings":{"title":"Faqs"}},"rich